      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "McCarr sits close to a cluster of Hatfield‑McCoy feud sites, turning the area into a historic landscape rather than a single landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
